{"4655050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "야간근무 - Finding", "steam_appid": 4655050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An infantry battalion somewhere in Gangwon Province.<br>You are assigned to your first night shift, monitoring multiple areas through a CCTV control system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange instructions.<br>Unexplainable changes on the screen.<br>And something… getting closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, the threat is not only inside the screen —<br>it may already be in the room with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the night shift?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor multiple CCTV feeds across the battalion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detect and identify anomalies appearing over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Report abnormalities using the reporting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your own position in the Command and Control Room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive from 00:00 to 06:00 without missing critical threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time progresses rapidly, and anomalies become more frequent and dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail to report them in time… and it may cost your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚠️ FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CCTV-based observation gameplay</strong><br>Switch between multiple camera feeds and detect subtle changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly detection system</strong><br>Identify environmental changes, intruders, and distortions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reporting mechanic</strong><br>Select and report the correct anomaly type to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Absurdity” system</strong><br>Discover hidden anomalies that blur the line between reality and the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong><br>Survival, death, and a hidden true ending depending on your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror atmosphere</strong><br>CRT-style visuals, noise, and tension-driven sound design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[It's ominous from the beginning].</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If you are confident, click OK]</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655050/extras/307421228e7e89f541788bd9b2dd3e1c.avif?t=1778484515\" width=602 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Keep your nerves sharp.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use the [Report] button to find and report abnormalities</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655050/extras/608b56fe7d4fed503ad72daed0c5fcae.avif?t=1778484515\" width=602 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Please note on security.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[Current repo